&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;As the Product Manager for Safety Platform, you&#39;ll drive the vision, strategy, and roadmap for Discord&#39;s safety systems. This team is the glue that holds our safety features together. They build the infrastructure that powers everything from detection layers to policy enforcement systems to user-facing features — and beyond. Keeping users safe is crucial for Discord&#39;s growth, and Safety Platform provides the foundation for this vital work. We&#39;re seeking an impact-driven, hands-on Product Manager to steer this team. This role reports to the Director of Product for Trust.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
