&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An expertise in web development.&lt;/strong&gt; You have a deep understanding of React, CSS, and Typescript.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of experience&lt;/li&gt;
