&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years experience as a software engineer, with experience as a technical lead.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical depth with JavaScript, with expertise or a desire to learn TypeScript and React.&lt;/li&gt;
